OL,4,CDouble jeopardy killer recommended for 
OL,5,Crelease from prison                    
OL,6,GA murderer who became the first person 
OL,7,Gtried after a change to the 800-year-  
OL,8,Gold double jeopardy law has been       
OL,9,Grecommended for release from prison.   
OL,11,FWilliam Dunlop, now 63, strangled      
OL,12,FJulie Hogg, 22, in Billingham, County  
OL,13,FDurham, in 1989 and hid her mutilated  
OL,14,Fbody behind a bath panel which was     
OL,15,Fdiscovered by her mother more than two 
OL,16,Fmonths later.                          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
