OL,4,CStalking law simplified to become one  
OL,5,Coffence                                
OL,6,GA new standalone offence of stalking   
OL,7,Gis to be created in England and Wales  
OL,8,Gafter a review found the law regarding 
OL,9,Gthe crime was "cluttered and confused" 
OL,10,G- but the maximum sentence will not be 
OL,11,Gincreased.                             
OL,13,FSpecific stalking offences were        
OL,14,Fintroduced in 2012 but the underlying  
OL,15,Foffence of harassment had to be        
OL,16,Festablished, and additional factors    
OL,17,Fsuch as fear or distress proven, for   
OL,18,Fit to be considered stalking.          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
