OL,4,CPoison GP loses bid to withdraw        
OL,5,Cattempt murder plea                    
OL,6,GAn ex-GP imprisoned for trying to      
OL,7,Gpoison his mother's partner with a     
OL,8,Gfake Covid jab has lost his bid to     
OL,9,Gwithdraw his guilty plea to a second   
OL,10,Gmurder attempt on the same man.        
OL,12,FThomas Kwan, 55, was previously jailed 
OL,13,Ffor more than 31 years for going in    
OL,14,Fdisguise to Patrick O'Hara's Newcastle 
OL,15,Fhome and injecting him with a toxic    
OL,16,Fchemical under the pretence of giving  
OL,17,Fa vaccination.                         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
