OL,4,CEx-roads minister Guy Opperman banned  
OL,5,Cfrom driving                           
OL,6,GFormer roads minister and Conservative 
OL,7,GMP Guy Opperman has been banned from   
OL,8,Gdriving.                               
OL,10,FOpperman was caught speeding in        
OL,11,FLambeth, South London, in May and      
OL,12,Falready had nine points on his licence.
OL,14,FThe former Hexham MP admitted the      
OL,15,Fspeeding offence at Bromley            
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court on 13 November.     
OL,18,FHe has been banned from driving for    
OL,19,Fsix months and ordered to pay #560     
OL,20,Fmade up of a #307 fine, #130 costs and 
OL,21,Fa court surcharge of #123.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
